  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and garlic and sauté until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the seafood mix and cook until the seafood is opaque and cooked through, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the tomato paste, lemon juice, chili flakes, cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Add 4 cups of water and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Use an immersion blender to puree the soup until smooth.",
    "Return the soup to the pot and add the heavy cream.",
    "Heat the soup over low heat until warmed through.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped parsley or cilantro if desired."
